msgid "Optional path to a declarative YAML or XML baseline manifest used by drift checks, Doctor checks, and MCP status abilities."
msgstr "Inzira itari ngombwa igana ku nyandiko shingiro y'igenamiterere ya YAML cyangwa XML isobanutse ikoreshwa mu isuzuma ry'itandukaniro, isuzuma rya Doctor, n'ubushobozi bw'imiterere bwa MCP."

